  "modifications": "All10 domestic directional/cumulative states, complete form and90 progressive frames reviewed in Codex in-app browser. Exact whole u8331-ue0102 and only declared ufa5e-03/u8279-k03/u6731@1. Literal revision1 captured read-only from original GlyphWiki revision edit page. No latest-version substitution. Historical K/ue0100/ue0101 have three-stroke 艹 and were not split. Selected complete variant declares full four-stroke 艹. Domestic3/4 reorder original right horizontal before right vertical. Raw groups0;1;3;2;4;5;6;7;8;9. All three quadratic primitives, polygons and engine defaults retained. Normalize200to100 and winding; no invented points, bridges, trimming, radical transplant or width changes. Archived records have no individual glyph revisions; literal u6731@1 has exact original author/date/hash. Licensed geometry is separate from domestic dictionary evidence and exam-body official approval.",
